          <rules>
            <rule name="Target Lock Interface" id="5c5e-df6a-2d4f-a8e7" hidden="false">
              <description>When the target lock interface is used the Pathfinder counts as having a hard-wired target lock, but the rail rifle will suffer from the 'get hot' weapon rule in the same way as plasma weapons. If the interface is not fitted, or if all members of the unit engage the same target, this does not happen.</description>
